sequenceDiagram
  participant Op as Lead(操作者)
  participant L as Codex Lead 进程
  participant HB as heartbeat.json
  participant P as Bridge 巡逻
  participant H as recover.sh(helper)
  participant LD as launchd
  participant D as Discord 告警频道 flywheel-alerts
  Op->>L: kill -STOP(假死:进程在,不干活)
  L--xHB: 心跳停止更新
  P->>HB: 每 20 tick 读一次
  P->>P: 180s 未更新 ⇒ heartbeat_stalled(连败计数 1..3)
  P->>D: 告警 detected(第一条真消息)
  P->>H: --recover(带 T0 的 pid / lstart / generation)
  H->>H: 核 pid+lstart+argv+CODEX_HOME,写 pre_mutation 回执
  H->>LD: 有界 kickstart -k(精确 label)
  LD->>L: 新一代出生(新 pid / 新 generation)
  L->>HB: 心跳恢复 state online
  P->>D: 告警 recovery converged(第二条真消息)
  Op->>Op: 核 D1–D6 谓词,收证据目录
